00:01:14.600 --> 00:01:17.690
In others like DayQuil,
there's caffeine in there.

00:01:17.690 --> 00:01:19.240
All right, that's my mistake.

00:01:19.240 --> 00:01:20.750
But I'm gonna say a 'but' here,

00:01:20.750 --> 00:01:23.800
because there might not
be caffeine in DayQuil.

00:01:23.800 --> 00:01:25.720
There's other stimulants in there

00:01:25.720 --> 00:01:27.350
