00:01:37.170 --> 00:01:38.450
in it because they theorize

00:01:38.450 --> 00:01:40.970
in large blood vessels, cause the headache

00:01:40.970 --> 00:01:42.500
and by shrinking the size of them

00:01:42.500 --> 00:01:43.770
by giving you caffeine

00:01:43.770 --> 00:01:45.840
which is an upper, they
