00:01:45.840 --> 00:01:47.170
therefore reduce some of that pain.

00:01:47.170 --> 00:01:48.730
So there's a lot of products out there

00:01:48.730 --> 00:01:49.750
that do have caffeine.

00:01:49.750 --> 00:01:51.330
DayQuil unfortunately, is not one of them

00:01:51.330 --> 00:01:53.180
