00:03:27.070 --> 00:03:28.880
The reality is there
exists something known

00:03:28.880 --> 00:03:31.630
as the photic sneeze reflex where you look

00:03:31.630 --> 00:03:33.450
at a bright light and
it causes you to sneeze.

00:03:33.450 --> 00:03:35.730
A lot of times this is just a mild reflex,

00:03:35.730 --> 00:03:37.570
but sometimes it can be quite serious.

00:03:37.570 --> 00:03:39.080
There's actually theories as

00:03:39.080 --> 00:03:42.200
to why this happens, not
even a well known mechanism.

00:03:42.200 --> 00:03:45.170
They theorize that it's
cranial nerve five and 10

00:03:45.170 --> 00:03:47.700
that are involved in creating this reflex.

00:03:47.700 --> 00:03:49.740
It's cool that they have a mechanism,

00:03:49.740 --> 00:03:51.356
but at the same time very weird

00:03:51.356 --> 00:03:53.460
that it's only a proposed mechanism,

00:03:53.460 --> 00:03:54.647
not even a well proven one.

