00:06:24.180 --> 00:06:25.760
What I was thinking to myself

00:06:25.760 --> 00:06:27.440
in my head, as I was talking about it was

00:06:27.440 --> 00:06:29.340
that post-traumatic growth was not

00:06:29.340 --> 00:06:30.760
in the literature that was being taught

00:06:30.760 --> 00:06:34.140
to me as a medical student, as a resident,

00:06:34.140 --> 00:06:35.280
as a doctor, really.

00:06:35.280 --> 00:06:36.930
Meaning that, a lot of the information

00:06:36.930 --> 00:06:37.990
that we were being presented with

00:06:37.990 --> 00:06:40.460
when it came to mental health was negative

00:06:40.460 --> 00:06:43.360
