00:06:53.500 --> 00:06:55.500
It's something that I just kind of came to

00:06:55.500 --> 00:06:56.520
in my own thinking.

00:06:56.520 --> 00:06:58.490
Later, looking back at
it, there was plenty

00:06:58.490 --> 00:07:01.360
