00:07:01.360 --> 00:07:02.810
Started reading books on the subject,

00:07:02.810 --> 00:07:04.150
learning more and more about it.

00:07:04.150 --> 00:07:05.230
I did not create it.

00:07:05.230 --> 00:07:07.090
I don't take credit for
post-traumatic growth.

00:07:07.090 --> 00:07:09.560
It's very easy to say,
