00:09:36.270 --> 00:09:38.860
by the medical community
as a true specific phobia,

00:09:38.860 --> 00:09:41.720
but it's the fear of small holes gathered

00:09:41.720 --> 00:09:43.500
or clustered closely together.

00:09:43.500 --> 00:09:45.560
And this image got people very nervous.

00:09:45.560 --> 00:09:47.170
I had to change this
thumbnail very quickly

00:09:47.170 --> 00:09:49.390
'cause the amount of comments
I got, we're staggering.

00:09:49.390 --> 00:09:50.290
Please tell me

00:09:50.290 --> 00:09:53.223
this is a neurosurgeon
doing this, not Foreman.

00:09:54.512 --> 00:09:57.060
(chuckles), It's Foreman, oh my God!

00:09:57.060 --> 00:10:00.350
They're all neurosurgeons,
infectious disease specialists,

00:10:00.350 --> 00:10:02.050
family medicine doctors.

00:10:02.050 --> 00:10:05.480
Okay, I can get offended here
and I still am allowed to,

00:10:05.480 --> 00:10:07.450
because they act like they do everything.

00:10:07.450 --> 00:10:09.670
They give no credit to nursing staff,

00:10:09.670 --> 00:10:13.790
CMA staff, respiratory techs,
just so many individuals

00:10:13.790 --> 00:10:16.300
in a hospital that work
to make it function.

00:10:16.300 --> 00:10:18.760
And actually, patients have
probably more contact time

00:10:18.760 --> 00:10:20.620
with those specialties and individuals

00:10:20.620 --> 00:10:22.190
than they do even with the doctors.

00:10:22.190 --> 00:10:24.730
But, a lot of you left comments saying

00:10:24.730 --> 00:10:27.280
that, "Wow, Dr. Mike's
not a true House MD fan

00:10:27.280 --> 00:10:29.406
because Foreman is
actually a neurosurgeon."

00:10:29.406 --> 00:10:33.060
(clears throat), I looked
up the House MD Wiki,

00:10:33.060 --> 00:10:34.070
didn't even know that existed,

00:10:34.070 --> 00:10:35.930
and Foreman actually did his residency

00:10:35.930 --> 00:10:38.660
in neurology so still not a neurosurgeon,

00:10:38.660 --> 00:10:41.630
and then applied to be
a fellow under Dr. House

00:10:41.630 --> 00:10:44.160
which I guess is like
an infectious disease

00:10:44.160 --> 00:10:46.540
or diagnostician fellowship.

00:10:46.540 --> 00:10:48.950
Still not a neurosurgery resident!

00:10:48.950 --> 00:10:52.190
Still not a neurosurgery
fellow, none of the above.

00:10:52.190 --> 00:10:54.770
He shouldn't be doing
this, it's unethical.

00:10:54.770 --> 00:10:57.780
So while I will take the loss by saying

00:10:57.780 --> 00:10:59.140
that he's not anything related

00:10:59.140 --> 00:11:01.770
to neurology, he's still
not a neurosurgeon.

00:11:01.770 --> 00:11:05.050
It's really unfortunate that
I have to knock out iDubbbz

00:11:05.050 --> 00:11:07.090
after having so much respect for him.

00:11:07.090 --> 00:11:09.550
But know that iDubbbz,
I'm only knocking you out

00:11:09.550 --> 00:11:11.497
because of the tremendous
respect I have for you.

00:11:11.497 --> 00:11:12.970
Oh, I messed up here.

00:11:12.970 --> 00:11:14.540
Okay, I didn't knock out iDubbbz only

00:11:14.540 --> 00:11:17.930
'cause I didn't know my man
has a chin of granite, steel.

00:11:17.930 --> 00:11:19.910
I don't know, what's an
indestructible substance?

00:11:19.910 --> 00:11:24.070
Whatever kryptonite he has, I
didn't have it in my knuckles

00:11:24.070 --> 00:11:25.337
and I need to get back to training.

00:11:25.337 --> 00:11:27.270
But I will say, I definitely hit harder

00:11:27.270 --> 00:11:29.270
than butterfly kisses, come on iDubbbz.

00:11:29.270 --> 00:11:31.770
- Sorry Dr. Mike, you
don't have knockout power.

00:11:31.770 --> 00:11:34.626
Your punches are like
little butterfly kisses.

00:11:34.626 --> 00:11:35.682
- [Commentator] Ooh, that right!

00:11:35.682 --> 00:11:37.343
His hands right now, big right hand!

00:11:37.343 --> 00:11:39.042
Throwing that right hand!

00:11:39.042 --> 00:11:41.143
That again, overhand.

00:11:41.143 --> 00:11:42.264
How is iDubbbz on stable legs

00:11:42.264 --> 00:11:44.212
after taking some of these shots?

00:11:44.212 --> 00:11:46.710
(butterfly smooching)

00:11:46.710 --> 00:11:48.840
- And huge congrats to iDubbbz and Anisa

00:11:48.840 --> 00:11:49.730
and Creator Clash

00:11:49.730 --> 00:11:53.270
for raising $1.3 million for charity.

00:11:53.270 --> 00:11:54.220
Woo!

00:11:54.220 --> 00:11:56.550
Obviously, I come down
hard on natural remedies.

00:11:56.550 --> 00:11:59.770
But here is a list of natural
remedies that actually work.

00:11:59.770 --> 00:12:00.730
Click here to check that out

00:12:00.730 --> 00:12:03.345
and as always, stay happy and healthy.

00:12:03.345 --> 00:12:05.928
(upbeat music)

